  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d1c94227-4b88-244b-9c38-3c1b5f9f4da3"],
 "; its rows are real-space lattice vectors."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->582207367,ExpressionUUID->"bec9e5e1-2900-584b-b653-3fab5ed31904"],

Cell["\<\
The output uses the same row-vector convention. Matching and distinct basis \
vectors satisfy the duality relation below.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->133085853,ExpressionUUID->"de8c3b6f-77f0-5a41-8996-191f94860558"],

Cell["\<\
The two-dimensional implementation embeds the basis in three dimensions and \
removes the auxiliary direction.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->851042939,ExpressionUUID->"fbd8cd30-ccb6-ad42-98cc-bb4b9c87c3fe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Writing the input and output basis vectors as rows of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox["A",
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "89fc835b-6f38-8544-9115-7bba04021d1e"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox["B",
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "b67df3ec-35a2-1440-aa09-6e2aa9948c76"],
 ", respectively,",
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"A", ".", 
      TemplateBox[{"B"},
       "Transpose"]}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]"}]}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontSize->14,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "cb75e1b1-60d9-d545-bd23-cff6c9c12db2"]
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1665504958,ExpressionUUID->"2374d771-7b22-784b-a63e-89a47ec3cd0d"]
}, Closed]],

